Package: sdcalc
Type: Package
Title: Standard Deviation, Variance and Relative Standard Deviation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ramesh-xyz", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "Ramesh-xyz@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Population and sample variance and standard deviation, sum of
    squared deviations, coefficient of variation and relative standard
    deviation with explicit formula choice and strict input validation:
    missing, infinite and non-numeric values raise errors instead of being
    dropped, and a zero mean is reported instead of returning infinity.
    Uses a corrected two-pass algorithm that stays accurate for data far
    from zero.
