URL: https://standarddeviationcalculator.net/,
    https://github.com/Ramesh-xyz/statistics-calculator-toolkit,
    https://ramesh-xyz.github.io/statistics-calculator-toolkit/
BugReports: https://github.com/Ramesh-xyz/statistics-calculator-toolkit/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
